      "message": "I talked with Lorenzo, there is the code which does the similar thing but I still need this method to generate v4-mapped v6 address from v4 address.\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Connectivity/staticlibs/device/com/android/net/module/util/netlink/StructInetDiagSockId.java;l\u003d117-123",
